Rule 1 (input must be a Tensor with valid dimensions)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
>>
Rule 2 (safely disable gradients to avoid dtype-related grad errors)
{v_4 : bool} |= v_4 = false
>>
Rule 3 (dtype override must match the input tensor’s dtype)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : dtype} |= v_2 = dtype_(v_1)
>>
Rule 4 (do not override layout via string; use default from input)
{v_3 : str} |= v_3 = "none"
>>
Rule 5 (do not pass memory_format as string; use default)
{v_5 : str} |= v_5 = "none"
>>
Rule 6 (if gradients are requested, do not change dtype from input)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : dtype, v_4 : bool} |= if v_4 then v_2 = dtype_(v_1)
